<view class="page shopping simple-shopping"><view class="simple-title">买什么</view><view class="simple-sub">{{items.length ? '还有 ' + remaining + ' 样待买，买好了就勾上。' : '做饭缺的材料，都放在这里。'}}</view><view class="shopping-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="shopping-row {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}"><view class="shopping-toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleItem"><view class="checkbox">{{item.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view><view class="shopping-name"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.sourceText}}</view></view></view><view class="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeItem">×</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">暂时没有要买的</view><view class="muted">在菜谱里，把缺少的材料加进来。</view><button class="secondary empty-home" bindtap="goHome">去看看能做什么</button></view><view wx:else class="local-note">同类材料已合并，用量可在菜谱里查看。</view></view><view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="tab-cta"><button class="primary" disabled="{{!checkedCount}}" bindtap="putAway">{{checkedCount ? '放入冰箱 · ' + checkedCount + ' 样' : '勾选已经买好的材料'}}</button></view>
